{"id":2399,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>机械工程学院家庭经济困难学生“齿轮与书香”励志读书会—共读《人间值得》温暖举行</p><p> &nbsp;2025年11月25日下午，由勤工委主办的“齿轮与书香”励志读书会在中北大学“一站式”学生社区博雅书院举行。来自机械工程学院的25级女生经济困难学生以“人间值得·向阳而生”为主题，共读励志书籍《人间值得》，在寒冬时节共享阅读温度，汲取前行力量。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oUzWukLNnfLmrfUUlUYM4r7o7Q2LNCn4UmAknzlDLNlsL8L0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyYL1ysM1yPozUbLRA7MNCZoRGYU4CbUlrkUl-ZLRfVMRWFU4vYnRAkLzWFMzlYnR9Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LaoRNsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30897&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/92276194908D6F8802C69AEBAB800E42/C72D8B12/552D8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onllu8MmUPLllDoU7rfn7lDMNLPUNQnkUz-PnRLZLm9sM4v0gihFp2hmCIa0LYh2UShVMYhkM7MVUNl4olQkUm6RUl-anmrfol-sU87DMzWFMRnkLRUiM8QFM7CDMNQkgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0LzU4oky4LR9bMYbw62S8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30897&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>破冰游戏“谁是卧底”迅速拉近彼此距离，现场笑声不断；共读环节同学们轮流朗读《人间值得》中触动内心的篇章，沉浸式品读经典。主题分享环节，大家结合自身经历畅谈感悟——有人因“平凡不等于平庸”而释怀学业焦虑，有人因“坚持自有力量”而重拾竞赛信心，一句句质朴的分享引发阵阵掌声。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oUzCuZnzWkLl7DLU46VnRfRU4WkU47nsLRLDoz-ZLR6Vol-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkU1h2L1yZUzCPnmUsUzl8UzVVozrfMR94nzM2nz-aolnFnzA7UlLYMRQFLz9ZUNLJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LaoRNsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30897&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6BBF28A61F47A54A1E95A483E3FE209D/E8DAC246/188BC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"679\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oUzCuZnzWkLl7DLU46VnRfRU4WkU47nsLRLDoz-ZLR6Vol-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkU1h2L1yZUzCPnmUsUzl8UzVVozrfMR94nzM2nz-aolnFnzA7UlLYMRQFLz9ZUNLJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LaoRNsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30897&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>活动尾声，同学们写下“给自己的励志箴言”，将对未来的自己的祝福化作继续前行的动力。手持书卷与箴言卡片，全员合影留念，定格“齿轮与书香”的温暖瞬间。</p><p>勤工委表示，将持续打造“齿轮与书香”品牌，把书籍的柔光与机械的坚韧交织，护航经济困难学生向阳成长。</p><p>一审一校：王愿诸</p><p>二审二校：朱炳樵</p><p>三审三校：王慧慧</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oUzWukLNnfLmrfUUlUYM4r7o7Q2LNCn4UmAknzlDLNlsL8L0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyYL1ysM1yPozUbLRA7MNCZoRGYU4CbUlrkUl-ZLRfVMRWFU4vYnRAkLzWFMzlYnR9Jqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4LaoRNsgtA8pUScc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=30897&e=.jpg"}